Hub model card: https://huggingface.co/BSC-LT/hubert-base-ca-2k

This project loads the encoder at inference time (Hugging Face cache). The
published classifier artifact `miquelt-9/cv26-hubert-svm-calibrated` contains
only a sklearn head (`model.joblib` + `metadata.json`); it does **not**
redistribute modified HuBERT weights. If a future release uploads fine-tuned
HuBERT checkpoints, those weights remain subject to Apache-2.0 and this notice.

